        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "c3f56bc1-d90e-3def-b815-c0fda963aef4",
                "word": "cycas",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8cea2953-32eb-3d0f-b8fb-79cdf6e2ef81",
                        "entry_id": "c3f56bc1-d90e-3def-b815-c0fda963aef4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Genre de plantes arborescentes (Cycas spp.) palmiformes de l’embranchement des Cycadophytes, croissant sous les tropiques et considérées comme des gymnospermes primitifs."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "568007d7-c5bf-447e-83a0-11ee6aea0b2c",
                                "sense_id": "8cea2953-32eb-3d0f-b8fb-79cdf6e2ef81",
                                "text": "Dans le genre Cycas, le centre de la rosette de feuilles se transforme en un \"cône\" indifférencié qui prolonge la tige : aux grandes feuilles végétatives composées succèdent des feuilles réduites mais qui ressemblent aux autres, composées, dont les folioles inférieures, très modifiées, portent des ovules."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ca1cf248-502e-406d-99ed-fc9457ee0701",
                                "sense_id": "8cea2953-32eb-3d0f-b8fb-79cdf6e2ef81",
                                "text": "De croissance très lente, le cycas ne produit souvent qu’une seule feuille par an."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2d2745c-d501-4d5b-9d89-932e2b8f3cce",
                                "sense_id": "8cea2953-32eb-3d0f-b8fb-79cdf6e2ef81",
                                "text": "Le cycas n’est consommé qu’en temps de disette par les communautés d’Épi. Mais c’est une plante ancienne et l’une des plus grandes plantes rituelles du Vanuatu."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cf6eda46-1524-4bea-9b95-a5459dafce8e",
                        "source_entry_id": "c3f56bc1-d90e-3def-b815-c0fda963aef4",
                        "source_sense_id": "8cea2953-32eb-3d0f-b8fb-79cdf6e2ef81",
                        "target_lang_word": "Sagopalmfarn",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fd2e18be-7226-484d-9ce2-9e3dbe2c9ccc",
                        "source_entry_id": "c3f56bc1-d90e-3def-b815-c0fda963aef4",
                        "source_sense_id": "8cea2953-32eb-3d0f-b8fb-79cdf6e2ef81",
                        "target_lang_word": "Cycas-Palmfarn",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "03fef45e-17f9-41c0-9960-5030cfc45d43",
                        "source_entry_id": "c3f56bc1-d90e-3def-b815-c0fda963aef4",
                        "source_sense_id": "8cea2953-32eb-3d0f-b8fb-79cdf6e2ef81",
                        "target_lang_word": "cycad",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cycad",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aeca3408-365d-3bc5-8dff-2d8c70bd0bcb",
                                        "entry_id": "db889624-3ec3-369b-b0b2-3a875253e7fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any plant of the division Cycadophyta, having a stout and woody trunk with a crown of large, hard and stiff, evergreen leaves."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b46dc3e4-cc8d-422b-8944-0d0febd7ed52",
                                                "sense_id": "aeca3408-365d-3bc5-8dff-2d8c70bd0bcb",
                                                "text": "As has been already remarked, the occurrence of genuine Cycads in the Carboniferous vegetation has not been demonstrated, and the same holds good of all the Palaeozoic floras. True Cycads, therefore, so far as known, make their first appearance in the Trias, at the commencement of the Mesozoic period, where they are represented by the genera Pterophyllum, Zamites, and Podozamites."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9f14613-263e-4536-8326-37d0b4078016",
                                                "sense_id": "aeca3408-365d-3bc5-8dff-2d8c70bd0bcb",
                                                "text": "Then, after incomputable years, he was no longer man but a man-like beast, roving in forests of giant fern and calamite, or building an uncouth nest in the boughs of mighty cycads."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29c7c18a-c4af-4940-980b-8ece3d6aa111",
                                                "sense_id": "aeca3408-365d-3bc5-8dff-2d8c70bd0bcb",
                                                "text": "I began to count the pools, each a flare of turquoise light lost behind the high walls of the villas with their screens of cycads and bougainvillaea."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "126f2822-8495-4243-9d34-4302dd8a2c1c",
                        "source_entry_id": "c3f56bc1-d90e-3def-b815-c0fda963aef4",
                        "source_sense_id": "8cea2953-32eb-3d0f-b8fb-79cdf6e2ef81",
